0..59 Comment "// A capability passed where one granting more is expected."
60..62 Comment "//"
63..135 Comment "// A capability grants the operations its type names, and a narrower one"
136..179 Comment "// never stands where a wider one is asked."
180..182 Comment "//"
183..253 Comment "// `save` writes through a capability that grants reading and writing."
254..331 Comment "// `widen` hands it one that grants reading alone, which the checker refuses."
332..334 Comment "//"
335..396 Comment "// - see: corpus/ledger/diagnostics/CapabilityAmplified.gandr"
398..433 Comment "// The filesystem\'s host interface."
